   - `showing_only`: keeps only what shows, so no unseen trap can stop the bot's answer. It also turns off the opponent's auto-end-turn (R345), so the opponent's turn never runs on into the bot's own draw or fatigue.
   - `doomed_on`: tries every legal action except R84's and the mulligan, trying "end turn" first. A failed step counts as an escape.
   - `board_lethal`: drops the card the opponent just drew.
   - A lethal that needs the opponent's turn to end (an end-of-turn trigger) is not counted. This is on purpose: it only errs towards playing on.

